<title>TURKEY: Turkish industrial output grows 4.3 pct in July.</title>
<headline>Turkish industrial output grows 4.3 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish industrial output rose 4.3 percent in July over the same 1995 month, the State Institute of Statistics said.</p>
<p>   INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT	   July 96   June 96   July 95</p>
<p>   Total mth/mth pct change   4.3	 2.6	 19.8</p>
<p>   Manufacturing		  3.8	 2.3	 21.8</p>
<p>   Mining			  -2.6	 0.9	  6.9</p>
<p>   Utilities		     11.0	 6.2	 13.5 SY</p>
</text>
